# Artifact output links (mandatory)

When you **create or save** outputs the user should open — previews, exports, logs, reports, JSON manifests, MCAP clips, and similar — include a **direct markdown link per file** in the same response. Do **not** treat every mentioned repository source file as an artifact.

## Required format

One link per artifact, full absolute path, no shortening:

```markdown
[head_rgb_wire_565s.png](file:///home/avolkov/.cursor/worktrees/vantage/hlny/data/tmp/ep002_wire_frames/head_rgb_wire_565s.png)
```

Also acceptable when `file://` does not open in the client: repeat the full path on its own line in a fenced block.

## Trigger (do this every time)

Apply this rule when **any** of the following are true:

- You used Write, a shell redirect, or a script to save output the user should open
- You say "saved to", "written to", "under `.../`", or "preview at"
- You show an image from a path you control (Read tool, GenerateImage, extracted frame)
- You list multiple outputs from one task (batch previews, manifest + images, etc.)

## Response checklist

Before ending the turn, if you produced on-disk artifacts:

1. **Link every file** the user might want to open (not just the directory)
2. Use the **full absolute path** in each link target
3. Put links in the **same message** as the preview or summary (not "paths available on request")
4. If images render inline, **still** include the links — inline display is not a substitute

## Forbidden (common failures)

- ❌ Only showing inline images with no per-file links
- ❌ Only giving a directory: `saved under data/tmp/foo/`
- ❌ Burying one path in prose without a clickable link
- ❌ Abbreviating paths (`~/git/...`, `hlny/data/tmp/...`)

## Examples

**Bad**

> Here are two frames from the wire segment. Saved under `data/tmp/ep002_wire_frames/`.

**Good**

> Wire segment previews:
> - [head_rgb_wire_565s.png](file:///home/avolkov/.cursor/worktrees/vantage/hlny/data/tmp/ep002_wire_frames/head_rgb_wire_565s.png)
> - [head_rgb_wire_580s.png](file:///home/avolkov/.cursor/worktrees/vantage/hlny/data/tmp/ep002_wire_frames/head_rgb_wire_580s.png)
